<title>SINGAPORE: F J Benjamin IPO subscribed about 29.88 times.</title>
<headline>F J Benjamin IPO subscribed about 29.88 times.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Luxury retailing group F J Benjamin's initial public offer has achieved a subscription rate of about 29.88 times, said an official from N. M. Rothschild &amp; Sons on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>The rate applies to the public portion of the IPO which comprised 40 million shares at Singapore $0.80 each.</p>
<p>The group had also made a successful placement of 10 million shares at the same price to institutional investors.</p>
<p>Trading of the shares will start on Thursday.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
